    "Edge alignment needs structured scenes with depth discontinuities and image edges; textureless or very distant scenes yield an inconclusive result.",
    "the cloud has no per-point time: image and scan are paired at the header stamp; the recording is shorter than 48 scans 1 s apart, so up to 48 scans at least 0.25 s apart were spread over it (median view change 0.067)"
